{"comment_text": {"ja53:0.1": "", "ja53:0.2": "", "ja53:0.3": "", "ja53:0.4": "", "ja53:1.1": "Rogues attempt to spike a rich man’s drink with a drug (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>bhesajja</i>) so they can rob him. But he sees that they do not touch their own drinks. ", "ja53:1.2": "Resolve <i lang='pi' translate='no'>aññāyaṁ</i> to <i lang='pi' translate='no'>aññā</i> + <i lang='pi' translate='no'>ayaṁ</i>, where <i lang='pi' translate='no'>aññā</i> (“unknowing”) is an adjective agreeing with <i lang='pi' translate='no'>kathā</i> (“talk”). ", "ja53:1.3": "", "ja53:1.4": "", "ja53:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja53:0.1": "<article id='ja53'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja53:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja53:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja53:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja53:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja53:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja53:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja53:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja53:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja53:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja53:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja53:0.3": "Āsīsavagga ", "ja53:0.4": "3. Puṇṇapātijātaka ", "ja53:1.1": "“Tatheva puṇṇā pātiyo, ", "ja53:1.2": "aññāyaṁ vattate kathā; ", "ja53:1.3": "Ākāraṇena jānāmi, ", "ja53:1.4": "na cāyaṁ bhaddikā surā”ti. ", "ja53:2.1": "Puṇṇapātijātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja53:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 53 ", "ja53:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja53:0.3": "Hope ", "ja53:0.4": "The Full Cups: a past life story ", "ja53:1.1": "The cups stay just as full, ", "ja53:1.2": "while the ignorant talk goes on. ", "ja53:1.3": "For this reason I know ", "ja53:1.4": "this is not an excellent beer. ", "ja53:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja53:0.1": "", "ja53:0.2": "", "ja53:0.3": "", "ja53:0.4": "", "ja53:1.1": "", "ja53:1.2": "", "ja53:1.3": "Ākāraṇena → ākārakena (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja53:1.4": "", "ja53:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja53:0.1": "", "ja53:0.2": "", "ja53:0.3": "", "ja53:0.4": "", "ja53:1.1": "ms22J_117, msdiv53, pts-vp-pli1.269, vri68.13", "ja53:1.2": "", "ja53:1.3": "", "ja53:1.4": "", "ja53:2.1": "ms22J_118"}, "keys_order": ["ja53:0.1", "ja53:0.2", "ja53:0.3", "ja53:0.4", "ja53:1.1", "ja53:1.2", "ja53:1.3", "ja53:1.4", "ja53:2.1"]}